## Welcome to your own oasis

At 55 m², our elegantly designed apartment is a retreat of comfort and space. It has a relaxing king-size bed, a lounge with a pull-out sofa bed, a spacious bathroom with a walk-in shower, and a fully equipped kitchenette for whatever you feel like cooking. Best of all, step out onto your own balcony for sun and a coffee. Ideal for longer stays, business or pleasure.
